#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:1
msgid "Model Insertion from Fuel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:3
msgid ""
"Ignition Fuel hosts hundreds of models that can easily be added to a world "
"running in the Ignition GUI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:6
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:8
msgid "Start by getting Ignition up and running with an empty world:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:10
msgid "ign gazebo empty.sdf\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:14
msgid ""
"The previous tutorial, [Manipulating Models](manipulating_models), shows you "
"how to interact with models, which might be helpful once you add some Fuel "
"models to your world."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:16
msgid "Choose a Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:18
msgid ""
"Fuel's model collection is at [app.gazebosim.org/fuel/models](https://app."
"gazebosim.org/fuel/models). Head over and browse the available content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:21
msgid "![Fuel models preview](img/fuel.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:21
msgid "Fuel models preview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:23
msgid ""
"Click on any one of the thumbnails, or use the search bar. For example, "
"let's find the [PR2_SDF17](https://app.gazebosim.org/openrobotics/fuel/"
"models/PR2_SDF17)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:26
msgid "![Vent](img/pr2_detail.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:26
msgid "Vent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:28
msgid ""
"Note that some of the model files are quite large and may take some time to "
"download into your world. Check that the file size on the right is "
"reasonable for your application before moving on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:31
msgid "Spawn a Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:33
msgid ""
"You can spawn models into simulation using the Resource Spawner plugin, or "
"you can simply copy the SDF snippet from the Fuel website using <> button "
"and paste it in your world SDF file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:35
msgid "![spawn](img/husky.gif)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:35
msgid "spawn"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:37
msgid ""
"Now you can add more models, or even load in any one of the plugins you "
"learned about to interact with the model the same way you could with the "
"shapes in the previous tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:39
msgid ""
"If you prefer to add a Fuel model permanently to an `sdf` file, you can just "
"as easily download the code by clicking the download-arrow icon to the right "
"of the model's image."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:41
msgid "Next Up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_insert.md:43
msgid "Stay tuned for new tutorials on the Ignition GUI and more!"
msgstr ""
